              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "I founded Zeta in 2018 with a dream shaped by what my husband and I wanted for our own children: <strong>an extraordinary education driven by love</strong>. As a parent, I saw how much more education could and should do for a child. Children deserve <strong>academic excellence, opportunities to discover their strengths, pursue their interests, build confidence, and develop into capable and kind human beings.</strong>"
